msgid "Run Maven install before starting the app"
msgstr "Ejecutar Maven install antes de iniciar la aplicación"

#: openpanel/internal/modules/appinstall/java.go:27
msgid ""
"When enabled, this option will first run mvn install using the pom.xml file,"
" then launch the application. If the application is already built, you can "
"skip this option."
